\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\qc\kerning2\b\f0\fs48\lang16393 Microsoft Agent Framework\par
\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj\b0\fs24 Microsoft Agent Framework (MAF) is a framework used to build AI agents that can reason, plan, use tools, access data, maintain memory, and automate business processes.\par
\b Key Components of MAF\par
1. Agent\par
\b0 The AI entity that interacts with users and performs tasks.\par
\b Examples:\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj HR Agent\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Customer Support Agent\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Recruitment Agent\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 2. Memory\par
\b0 Stores conversation and task history.\par
\b Types:\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj Short-Term Memory\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Long-Term Memory\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Vector Memory\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 3. Planner\par
\b0 Breaks complex tasks into smaller steps and creates an execution plan.\par
\b Example:\b0  Goal \f1\u8594?\f0\lang16393  "Hire a Python Developer"\par
Plan:\par

\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj Find candidates\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Match skills\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Rank candidates\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Generate report\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 4. Tools\par
\b0 External resources used by the agent.\par
\b Examples:\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj SQL Database\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}APIs\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Microsoft Graph\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Email Services\par
{\pntext\f3\'B7\tab}Search Services\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 5. Orchestrator\par
\b0 Manages coordination between multiple agents and tools.\par
\par

